{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>為慶祝邁向59周年，電視廣播城將於11月19日首辦400米賽跑競技環節。昨日六大參賽名單正式曝光，大師姐陳庭欣慘遭一眾師妹挑釁。這場熱血對決最終誰勝誰負充滿變數。</p>\n<h2>六位東張女神過磅抽籤火藥味濃</h2>\n<p>昨日賽前記者會由關曜儁擔任司儀，正式公開六位《東張西望》參賽跑女名單，包括陳庭欣、李旻芳、黎寬怡、梁敏巧、何沛珈及甘詠寧。眾人穿上運動戰衣亮相，並仿效專業賽事進行公開過磅及即場抽籤決定出賽號碼與賽道。當中資深外景主持李旻芳錄得116磅，對撼全場最輕盈僅105磅並被視為大熱門黎寬怡。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445628885886700_1211762416af53ae17bc96.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445628885886700_1211762416af53ae17bc96.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629098163709_4478583226af53ae357370.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629098163709_4478583226af53ae357370.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>大師姐陳庭欣反擊揚言秘密操肌雪恥</h2>\n<p>平日主力坐鎮錄影廠主持工作被笑指缺乏街頭追訪實戰經驗，陳庭欣面對外景師妹重點狙擊毫不退縮。她透露為備戰今次400米大戰已刻意暫停打球一星期，並轉攻健身室狂練腿部肌肉。陳庭欣更即場反擊表示：「我依家每日收工都會陪外景同事一齊『追巴士』練習，到時大家千祈唔好睇小我！」</p>\n<h2>梁敏巧40分鐘狂奔追擊獸父成經典</h2>\n<p>今次賽事旨在將日常狂奔追訪涉事者畫面搬上真實賽道。回顧過去最彪炳戰績，去年梁敏巧追查案件時與拔足逃跑涉事人展開長達40分鐘街頭追逐戰。她當時由大廈一路狂追至鬧市街頭，期間緊咬不放並厲聲質問：「我看到你現在刪除照片，先生！你為什麼要這麼害怕？」最終力追至警方到場將男子拘捕。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e6%a2%81%e6%95%8f%e5%b7%a7-%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b-%e8%bf%bd%e9%80%90%e6%88%b0-3382785/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張西望｜梁敏巧旺角街頭40分鐘追逐戰 自爆擁有「驚人體力」秘訣</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/177319864898192419_128807043669b0dd3949a89.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 梁敏巧40分鐘狂奔追擊獸父成經典（圖片來源：截圖@TVB《東張西望》）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/177319864898192419_128807043669b0dd3949a89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>梁敏巧40分鐘狂奔追擊獸父成經典（圖片來源：截圖@TVB《東張西望》）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629522990896_18280715306af53ae7aa496.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：截圖@TVB《東張西望》）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629522990896_18280715306af53ae7aa496.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：截圖@TVB《東張西望》）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>觀眾湧入官方平台競猜最終跑女賽果</h2>\n<p>為了增加賽事刺激感，官方網站及社交平台已同步推出競猜遊戲，讓觀眾預測哪位參賽者會拿下第一名及最後一名。大批網民隨即湧入留言區參與討論，有人留言表示：「大師姐隨時爆冷跑出」、「最輕磅實著數」，熱烈分析六位選手實力。目前投票活動將持續至下周四晚公佈賽果前。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nj7ia-1_17720696226af53caf596f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nj7ia-1_17720696226af53caf596f4.jpg\" width=\"787\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/513df06b-a6f9-4d15-b8c7-2f5339c85ea0_16982145006af53cb526223-1024x820.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"769\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/513df06b-a6f9-4d15-b8c7-2f5339c85ea0_16982145006af53cb526223-1024x820.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/arjaz-1_17414018006af53cab606cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/arjaz-1_17414018006af53cab606cf.jpg\" width=\"938\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hxnhk-1_13099926af53cb3122f9-1024x696.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"653\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hxnhk-1_13099926af53cb3122f9-1024x696.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ev6dj-1_9810930446af53caa0bbea-1024x675.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"633\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ev6dj-1_9810930446af53caa0bbea-1024x675.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rxtb4-1_6599744386af53cb149a83-1024x723.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"678\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rxtb4-1_6599744386af53cb149a83-1024x723.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6jdmh-1_6946744606af53ca8e40a2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6jdmh-1_6946744606af53ca8e40a2.jpg\" width=\"1018\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/qprks-1_18291279866af53cad63d9a-1024x720.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"675\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/qprks-1_18291279866af53cad63d9a-1024x720.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629687751741_6614731906af53ae95382c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629687751741_6614731906af53ae95382c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.601007+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1132,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:37:26.166359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:21.331591+00:00","content_hash":"24abc64d30bb4e6da43ee63ce61aabbb0c63832dd9a212d5f3b8ed67a580531e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}